{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"6e7e895a-f449-453e-8538-65d9284dcc59","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full context. Let me extract Q5.3:\n\n**Q5.3**: 在 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 的多算子/微算子并发场景下，片上网络（NoC / Mesh / Crossbar / Ring / 树形互联）和片间互联如何设计来支撑计算单元间的高带宽、低延迟通信？有哪些关键的互联架构方法和拓扑选择？\n\n**预关键词**: Network-on-Chip (NoC, 片上网络), mesh topology (Mesh拓扑), crossbar (交叉开关), ring interconnect (环形互联), tree interconnect (树形互联), on-chip bus (片上总线), AXI (Advanced eXtensible Interface), AHB/APB, high-bandwidth interconnect (高带宽互联), low-latency communication (低延迟通信), flow control (流控), wormhole routing (虫洞路由), virtual channel (虚拟通道), credit-based flow control, router microarchitecture (路由器微架构), bisection bandwidth (对分带宽), collective communication (集合通信), all-reduce, all-to-all (MoE expert), multicast, chiplet interconnect (Chiplet互联), UCIe (Universal Chiplet Interconnect Express), BoW (Bridge of Wires), silicon interposer, advanced packaging (先进封装), die-to-die communication, MoE all-to-all communication, DiT spatial parallelism data exchange, multimodal encoder-decoder cross communication, video pipeline streaming interconnect\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Semantically decompose Q5.3 into logical chain nodes\n2. Search the vault across four directories for each node\n3. Read relevant notes\n4. Write the answer (L5 granularity: dataflow diagrams, control module tables)\n\nLet me decompose the question:\n\n**Q5.3**: 在 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 的多算子/微算子并发场景下，片上网络（NoC / Mesh / Crossbar / Ring / 树形互联）和片间互联如何设计来支撑计算单元间的高带宽、低延迟通信？有哪些关键的互联架构方法和拓扑选择？\n\nLogical chain decomposition:\n\nS1: MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 负载 → 模型负载特征对互联的需求\n- 角色: 对象/模型负载\n- 核心概念: MoE all-to-all communication, DiT spatial parallelism, multimodal cross-modal, video streaming\n- Long query: `\"MoE all-to-all\" interconnect NoC`\n- Fallback: `MoE expert communication`, `all-to-all NoC`\n\nS2: 多算子/微算子并发 → 并发场景对互联的挑战\n- 角色: 计算场景/约束\n- 核心概念: multi-operator concurrency