{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"6e7e895a-f449-453e-8538-65d9284dcc59","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在我已经读取了 Q5.3 的完整内容。让我执行 Step 1：语义分割并开始搜索。\n\n## Q5.3 语义分割\n\n**问题**: 在 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 的多算子/微算子并发场景下，片上网络（NoC / Mesh / Crossbar / Ring / 树形互联）和片间互联如何设计来支撑计算单元间的高带宽、低延迟通信？有哪些关键的互联架构方法和拓扑选择？\n\n| 节点 | 原文片段 | 逻辑角色 | 核心概念 | 长匹配 Query |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|-------------|\n| S1 | MoE、DiT、多模态、Video | 对象/模型负载 | MoE all-to-all, DiT spatial, multimodal cross-modal, video streaming | `\"MoE\" \"all-to-all\" communication interconnect` |\n| S2 | 多算子/微算子并发 | 计算场景/约束 | concurrent kernels, micro-operator, communication contention | `\"multi-operator\" concurrency \"on-chip\" communication` |\n| S3 | 片上网络 NoC/Mesh/Crossbar/Ring/树形 | 核心机制-拓扑 | NoC topology, router microarchitecture, wormhole, virtual channel, flow control | `\"Network-on-Chip\" topology mesh crossbar ring` |\n| S4 | 片间互联 | 核心机制-片间 | chiplet, UCIe, BoW, interposer, die-to-die, advanced packaging | `chiplet interconnect UCIe \"die-to-die\" packaging` |\n| S5 | 高带宽、低延迟通信 | 约束/指标 | bisection bandwidth, credit-based flow control, collective communication, multicast | `\"low latency\" \"high bandwidth\" NoC bisection` |\n| S6 | 关键互联架构方法和拓扑选择 | 综合回答 | topology selection, interconnect architecture methodology | `interconnect architecture methodology \"topology selection\"` |\n\n现在开始四目录 Level A 搜索："}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":21435,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"798993e8-b887-4149-9ab7-aa3cb25c3e8f","uuid":"85d4ff01-297a-4e8c-bf63-e949a82b345d"}
