:"All-to-All","offset":4529},{"match":"token","offset":4561}],"excerpt":"…据Router输出分发到持有对应expert的设备，以及将expert输出传回原始设备。MoEShard 采用不同策略：通过 token 全复制（all GPU send all tokens）替代 all-to-all scatter/gather，在 NVLink 高带宽下 overhead 可忽略。\n术语是什么？\n在MoE Expert Parallelism中，一个MoE层需要两次All-to-All操作：\n1. **All-to-All Dispatch**：将每个设备上的token根据Router的expert选择分发到持有对应expert的设备\n2. **All-to-All Combine**：将expert计算后的输出传回原始设备\n执行时间由计算和通信两个阶段主导，通信通常是瓶颈。\nMoEShard 的替代方案：不做 all-to-all scatter/gathe…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hierarchical All-to-All.md","basename":"Hierarchical All-to-All","score":1254.0448033936118,"foundWords":["all","all是针对moe","all伪代码","all的关键洞察","all允许所有gpu直接相互通信","all拆分为intra","alltoall","all实现","all-to-all","to","topology信息（哪些gpu在同一节点）","topology信息","tokens:","tokens,","tokens_per_gpu","tokens","all-to-all","moe"],"matches":[{"match":"All-to-All","offset":16},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":35},{"match":"MoE","offset":48},{"match":"all","offset":62},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":81},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":156},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":190},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":351},{"match":"alltoall","offset":382},{"match":"tokens,","offset":391},{"match":"tokens:","offset":436},{"match":"tokens_per_gpu","offset":455},{"match":"to","offset":658},{"match":"tokens","offset":792},{"match":"tokens","offset":1187},{"match":"to","offset":1194},{"match":"MoE","offset":1231},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1240},{"match":"MoE","offset":1303},{"match":"MoE","offset":1312},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1318},{"match":"MoE","offset":1343},{"match":"to","offset":1359},{"match":"topology信息（哪些GPU在同一节点）","offset":1424},{"match":"MoE","offset":1648},{"match":"to","offset":1705}],"excerpt":"## Hierarchical All-to-All\n术语解释\n分层All-to-All是针对MoE Expert Parallelism的通信优化策略，将全局All-to-All拆分为intra-node（节点内高带宽）和inter-node（节点间低带宽）两个层次，充分利用两级带宽。\n术语是什么？\n传统All-to-All允许所有GPU直接相互通信，带宽使用效率低。分层All-to-All的关键洞察：\n- 同节点GPU通过NVLink/NVSwitch互联，带宽极高（~900GB/s）\n- 跨节点GPU通过InfiniBand/RoCE互联，带宽相对较低（~200GB/s）\n- 应先在同节点内聚合数据，再跨节点传输，…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE Training.md","basename":"All-to-All Communication in MoE Training","score":1240.0314357117747,"foundWords":["all","all_to_all），以处理不同","all-to-all","to","torch","tokens（序列长度","tokens，形成","tokens","token","all-to-all","moe"],"matches":[{"match":"All-to-All","offset":3},{"match":"MoE","offset":31},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":89},{"match":"MoE","offset":104},{"match":"all","offset":125},{"match":"MoE","offset":144},{"match":"tokens","offset":161},{"match":"tokens，形成","offset":269},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":279},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":309},{"match":"tokens","offset":338},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":382},{"match":"token","offset":425},{"match":"MoE","offset":453},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":464},{"match":"MoE","offset":572},{"match":"MoE","offset":737},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":765},{"match":"tokens（序列长度","offset":845},{"match":"token","offset":888},{"match":"token","offset":974},{"match":"MoE","offset":1233},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1371},{"match":"MoE","offset":1427},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1436},{"match":"token","offset":1459},{"match":"tokens","offset":1499},{"match":"MoE","offset":1521},{"match":"MoE","offset":1552},{"match":"Torch","offset":1650},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1663},{"match":"torch","offset":1680},{"match":"all","offset":1698},{"match":"to","offset":1702},{"match":"all","offset":1705},{"match":"All","offset":1724},{"match":"To","offset":1727},{"match":"All","offset":1729},{"match":"MoE","offset":1744},{"match":"MoE","offset":1754},{"match":"MoE","offset":1763},{"match":"token","offset":1793},{"match":"all_to_all），以处理不同","offset":1827},{"match":"tokens","offset":1851},{"match":"MoE","offset":1873},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1879},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1983},{"match":"MoE","offset":2049},{"match":"MoE","offset":2117},{"match":"MoE","offset":2135},{"match":"MoE","offset":2300},{"match"