l。与","offset":1750},{"match":"alltoallv","offset":1777},{"match":"MoE","offset":1838},{"match":"all-to-all","offset":1860},{"match":"to","offset":1881},{"match":"MoE","offset":1960}],"excerpt":"…Communication 是 ScaleMoE 论文提出的 MoE 分布式训练通信优化技术。传统 MoE 训练框架（DeepSpeed, Tutel）在 expert parallelism 的 all-to-all 通信中，为统一各 GPU 的 message size 而大量使用 zero padding——由于 expert selection 高度不均衡，zero ratio 从训练初期的 88% 迅速升至 98%，导致通信量严重膨胀。Adaptive All-to-All 在运行时监控每个 GPU 的 per-expert token 选择计数，通过一次 all-gather 操作聚合所有 GPU 的计数信息，计算精确的 input slice（第 i 列发给 GPU-i 的 token 数）和 output slice（第 j 行从 GPU-j 接收的输出数），然后使用 N…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Group-wise All-to-All Communication.md","basename":"Group-wise All-to-All Communication","score":1069.1056167180614,"foundWords":["all","all_devices_128,","all_to_all","all-gather","all-to-all:","all-to-all","to","tokens","token","all-to-all","moe"],"matches":[{"match":"All-to-All","offset":14},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":96},{"match":"MoE","offset":138},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":144},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":171},{"match":"all","offset":212},{"match":"token","offset":225},{"match":"all","offset":252},{"match":"All-Gather","offset":263},{"match":"token","offset":277},{"match":"MoE","offset":443},{"match":"All-to-All:","offset":505},{"match":"token","offset":542},{"match":"All_to_All","offset":570},{"match":"all_devices_128,","offset":581},{"match":"tokens","offset":598},{"match":"All-to-All:","offset":620},{"match":"token","offset":682},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":774},{"match":"tokens","offset":810},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":849},{"match":"token","offset":897},{"match":"all_to_all","offset":925},{"match":"All-Gather","offset":974},{"match":"token","offset":1033},{"match":"all","offset":1059},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1267},{"match":"MoE","offset":1368},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1392},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1408},{"match":"MoE","offset":1509},{"match":"MoE","offset":1529}],"excerpt":"## Group-wise All-to-All Communication\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\nGroup-wise All-to-All 是 MindSpore 框架内置的一种分层集合通信算法，专为 MoE 的 All-to-All 通信优化设计。核心思想是将全量 All-to-All 通信拆分为多个维度并行执行：在 EP (Expert Parallel) 域进行实际 token 交换 → 在 TP (Tensor Parallel) 域通过 All-Gather 同步 token 数据。由于 TP 域通常在同一节点内（利用 HCCS 256G…"},{"filename":"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/All-to-All Communication in MoE Training.md","basename":"All-to-All Communication in MoE Training","score":1048.220807723489,"foundWords":["all","all-to-all（每个","all-to-all）**：每个","all-to-all），而非","all-to-all，不同","all-to-all","to","torch","topology-aware","topology","top-k","top","tokens","token","all-to-all","moe"],"matches":[{"match":"all-to-all","offset":1905},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":3},{"match":"MoE","offset":31},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":52},{"match":"MoE","offset":65},{"match":"all","offset":83},{"match":"MoE","offset":102},{"match":"token","offset":127},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":152},{"match":"tokens","offset":165},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":225},{"match":"tokens","offset":242},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":271},{"match":"tokens","offset":300},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":385},{"match":"Torch","offset":401},{"match":"torch","offset":411},{"match":"all","offset":429},{"match":"to","offset":433},{"match":"all","offset":436},{"match":"MoE","offset":548},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":555},{"match":"All-to-All（每个","offset":588},{"match":"All-to-All），而非","offset":619},{"match":"MoE","offset":640},{"match":"MoE","offset":695},{"match":"all","offset":890},{"match":"MoE","offset":909},{"match":"tokens","offset":947},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1024},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1074},{"match":"MoE","offset":1147},{"match":"All-to-All","offset":1171},{"match":"topology","offset":1194},{"match":"Torch","offset":1313},{"match":"torch","offset":1323},{"match":"all","offset":1341},{"match":"to","offset":1345},{"match":"all","offset":1348},{"match":"MoE","offset":1495},{"match":"token","offset":1504},{"match":"tok