{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_09_UUIFYjkOw1u4q3WXSrko7330","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/芯片知识笔记/Open Chiplet Ecosystem and Inter-Chiplet Deadlock _ 开放芯粒生态与跨芯粒死锁.md\",\"basename\":\"Open Chiplet Ecosystem and Inter-Chiplet Deadlock _ 开放芯粒生态与跨芯粒死锁\",\"score\":3299.5629811828303,\"foundWords\":[\"chiplet\",\"chiplet\\\"的模块化目标矛盾。本文的\",\"chiplet。但\",\"chiplet（芯粒），不同供应商的\",\"interconnect\",\"ucie\",\"ucie）直接互连，无需了解彼此内部实现细节即可组成完整系统。ucie\",\"die-to-die\",\"die\",\"to\",\"die-to-die\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"die-to-die\",\"offset\":181},{\"match\":\"Chiplet\",\"offset\":8},{\"match\":\"Chiplet\",\"offset\":36},{\"match\":\"Chiplet\",\"offset\":82},{\"match\":\"chiplet（芯粒），不同供应商的\",\"offset\":147},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":166},{\"match\":\"die-to-die\",\"offset\":181},{\"match\":\"UCIe）直接互连，无需了解彼此内部实现细节即可组成完整系统。UCIe\",\"offset\":197},{\"match\":\"Chiplet\",\"offset\":305},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":331},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":374},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":407},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":444},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":553},{\"match\":\"chiplet。但\",\"offset\":593},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":632},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":739},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":809},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":890},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":970},{\"match\":\"UCIe\",\"offset\":1086},{\"match\":\"Chiplet\",\"offset\":1104},{\"match\":\"Interconnect\",\"offset\":1112},{\"match\":\"die-to-die\",\"offset\":1178},{\"match\":\"Chiplet\",\"offset\":1207},{\"match\":\"chiplet\",\"offset\":1359},{\"match\":\"Chiplet\",\"offset\":1609},{\"match\":\"Chiplet\",\"offset\":1639}],\"excerpt\":\"…Chiplet Ecosystem 是一种模块化芯片设计范式，目标是将传统 monolithic SoC \\\"解耦\\\"为多个可复用的 chiplet（芯粒），不同供应商的 chiplet 可通过标准化 die-to-die 接口（如 UCIe）直接互连，无需了解彼此内部实现细节即可组成完整系统。UCIe 等标准定义了 physical layer 和 link layer，但不保证互连网络在拓扑组合后仍然 deadlock-