{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"b38d0dda-4e31-4d3e-ae7c-eb38b4c9121b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I now have very comprehensive evidence from the vault. Let me now compile the answer for Q5.3. I have:\n\n**Key evidence organized by logical chain node:**\n\n**S1 (MoE/DiT/多模态/Video通信需求):**\n- NVLink knowledge note: MoE all-to-all token exchange, 600 GB/s bidirectional\n- 3D NMP note: 2D mesh NoC for MoE all-to-all dispatch/combine\n- X-MoE paper: all-to-all on HPC with hierarchical network\n- DeepSeek-V3 paper: NVLink + NVSwitch topology\n- MoE-GPS: all-to-all communication dominant in MoE\n\n**S3 (NoC拓扑/路由):**\n- RDN note: 2D mesh of non-blocking switches, 3 fabrics (vector/scalar/control), credit-based flow control\n- 2D Mesh NoC note: XY routing, Manhattan distance, 25-75 GB/s per link\n- Meta MTIA: 8×8 PE array, crossbar-based NoC, non-blocking, leaky-bucket traffic shaping\n- FEATHER paper: fat-tree, crossbar distribution NoC\n- CDG note: wormhole, virtual channel, deadlock-free routing\n- gem5/Garnet note: cycle-accurate NoC simulation\n\n**S4 (Chiplet/片间互联):**\n- Open Chiplet Ecosystem note: UCIe, active interposer, DFBM\n- Active Interposer note: 4×4 mesh, XY routing, 3 VN, virtual cut-through\n- Multi-Chiplet GPU note: concentrated hierarchical crossbar, 768GB/s, 32 cycles/hop\n- SoW note: LSI + XSR SerDes, 1.7 TB/s D2D, 200 ns/hop\n- AMD Infinity Fabric: full mesh, 7 links/GPU, >50 GB/s/link\n\n**S5 (高带宽低延迟):**\n- RDN note: credit-based per-hop and end-to-end flow control, packet throttling\n- NVLink/NVSwitch note: 450-900 GB/s, SHARP in-network reduction\n- DFBM paper: credit-based injection regulation, deadlock buffer\n\n**S6 (方法对比/拓扑选择):**\n- DFBM paper: comparison table (MTR, DeFT, RC, UPP, Steered Bubble vs DFBM)\n- SCAR paper: multi-chiplet scheduling with network-on-package\n- MixNet paper: reconfigurable optical-electrical fabric for MoE\n- CoCoTree paper: hierarchical binary tree for collective communication\n\nNow let me write the comprehensive L5 answer. I need to make sure it meets the L5 granularity requirements:\n- Mermaid flowchart for dataflow path\n- Control module detail table\n- ≥100 lines\n- Annotations after every structured element\n\nLet me write this now.","signature":"b38d0dda-4e31-4d3e-ae7c-eb38b4c9121b"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":118577,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"798993e8-b887-4149-9ab7-aa3cb25c3e8f","uuid":"cf8a39b2-28c3-4608-892b-599bcd0c6f55"}
